  "description": "Tapline's router hosted in ASP.NET Core: real-time, last-mile fan-out of shared state and ordered messages, over a Blazor Server circuit or MagicOnion (gRPC); data providers in process or in their own; sign-in by modules (passkeys, passthrough, tickets, your own); the ops port, the router's viewer and the browser client (tapline.js).",
